      "summary": "<p>The <strong>Instagram</strong> accounts for the Obama White House and the Chief Master Sergeant of the U.S. Space Force were briefly defaced with pro-Iranian images and messages over the weekend, after instructions began circulating on Telegram showing how to trick Meta&#8217;s &#8220;AI support assistant&#8221; bot into resetting account passwords.</p>\n<div id=\"attachment_73755\" style=\"width: 721px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-73755\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\" wp-image-73755\" src=\"https://krebsonsecurity.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/metasupportbot.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"711\" height=\"650\" /><p id=\"caption-attachment-73755\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">A screenshot from a video released on Telegram claiming to show how Meta&#8217;s AI customer support bot could be tricked into resetting a target&#8217;s password.</p></div>\n<p>On May 31, word began to spread on several Telegram instant message channels that Meta&#8217;s AI bot would h",
